# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Atomic-write temporaries
*.tmp

# Runtime state — data/servers.json also holds a live shutdown token
data/servers.json

# Refetchable caches. Large, and any refresh rebuilds them from the feeds.
data/live.json
data/history-*.json
data/locations.json
data/nil.json
data/talent.json

# Deliberately NOT ignored, because neither can be recovered if lost:
#   data/picks.sqlite3     your saved picks and wagers
#   data/rank_history.json archived poll snapshots; ESPN only ever serves the
#                          current poll, so a missing week is missing forever
